tal divinity. These beings, dubbed <i>conduits</i>, possess immense power and are sought after by both factions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the adventurers. These are unallied persons who through great struggle manage to survive in these torn lands. They regularly get hired by both The Clergy and The Dwellers to fulfill various contracts, such as culling the myriad of aggressive species littering the lands, or clearing out old ruins and dungeons for valuable items used in their great work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resources are scarce and competition for them fierce. The hostile lands are ruthless and the dungeons that exist within even more so. There is no way but forward - ever unto the next sunrise. Adventurers, protect your <i>Threads of life</i>, or find yourselves drifting away into the endless ocean of death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461810/extras/a976563e994174838ba804553bcdd840.poster.avif?t=1758273822\" width=616 height=144 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461810/extras/a976563e994174838ba804553bcdd840.webm?t=1758273822\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461810/extras/a976563e994174838ba804553bcdd840.mp4?t=1758273822\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461810/extras/893fef05750bb1c06c7f5b7bc6b16355.webp?t=1758273822\" width=616 height=50 /></span></p>","developers":["Jani Elojoki"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"