0967ea2cc31a99318f9f6ed544ad175f803810e3.600x338.jpg?t=1758273822"}],"short_description":"Gloomy dungeon crawler with turn-based, party-based, permadeath combat. Discover truths and treasures in a long-since-doomed world. Customize your party to fit your play style. Grapple with grief and mortality. Explore, despair, overcome.","steam_appid":3461810,"support_info":{"email":"threadeddungeonsdev@gmail.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English, Finnish","type":"game","website":null}